  "title": "＜FIM Grand Prix World Championship - MotoGP＞ HRC Reaches Agreement with Fabio Quartararo and David Alonso",
  "summary": "Honda Global | Honda Racing Corporation (HRC) has reached agreement with Fabio Quartararo, the 2021 FIM Grand Prix World Championship MotoGP World Champion and current MotoGP rider, and David Alonso, who is currently competing in the FIM Grand Prix World Championship Moto2 class, to join HRC’s MotoGP program from the 2027 season.",
